Task 1: Create a Playbook for Rolling Updates
Subtask 1.1: Understanding Rolling Updates

Rolling updates allow you to update your application or infrastructure gradually, ensuring that some instances remain available while others are being updated. This approach minimizes downtime and reduces risk.

Key Benefits:

    Zero or minimal downtime
    Gradual risk exposure
    Easy rollback capabilities
    Continuous service availability

