Issue 3: Rollback Issues

Problem: Rollback fails due to missing backups

Solution:

# Check available backups
ansible webservers -i inventory/hosts.yml -m find -a "paths=/var/www/html patterns='index.html.backup*'" --become

# Manual rollback
ansible webservers -i inventory/hosts.yml -m copy -a "src=/var/www/html/index.html.backup dest=/var/www/html/index.html remote_src=yes" --become

